# Every text file in this repository is stored and checked out with LF endings,
# on every platform. Git for Windows ships with `core.autocrlf=true`, which
# rewrites LF to CRLF on checkout; `forge fmt --check` then reports a whole-file
# diff on every Solidity source it touches, on a tree nobody has edited. The
# blobs here are already LF, so this file changes nothing in history - it only
# stops the checkout from changing them.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Assets Git should never inspect for line endings.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
*.mp4 binary
